<view class="ui-page address-edit"><view class="address-edit-head"><text class="ui-kicker">把配送信息，认真填好</text><view class="ui-title">{{title}}</view></view><view class="address-form"><view class="address-field"><text>收货人</text><input value="{{name}}" maxlength="40" bindinput="onName" placeholder="姓名" placeholder-class="address-placeholder"/></view><view class="address-field"><text>手机号码</text><input type="number" value="{{phone}}" maxlength="11" bindinput="onPhone" placeholder="用于配送联系" placeholder-class="address-placeholder"/></view><picker class="address-field address-region" mode="region" value="{{region}}" bindchange="onRegion"><text>所在地区</text><view class="{{regionDisplay?'':'address-placeholder'}}">{{regionDisplay||'请选择省 / 市 / 区'}}</view><yx-icon name="arrow" size="28" tone="muted"/></picker><view class="address-detail"><text>详细地址</text><textarea value="{{detail}}" maxlength="180" bindinput="onDetail" placeholder="街道、小区、楼栋及门牌号" placeholder-class="address-placeholder"/></view><view class="address-default-row"><view><text>设为默认地址</text><text>下次兑换时优先选择</text></view><switch checked="{{isDefault}}" color="#20352E" bindchange="onDefault"/></view></view><view class="address-privacy"><yx-icon name="info" size="30" tone="green"/><text>地址保存在当前设备，提交订单时用于商品配送。请确认姓名和联系方式准确。</text></view><view class="address-save"><button class="ui-primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="onSave">保存并使用</button></view></view>